:21:Link
# 0 for bero transition (regular transition) (just transitions)
# exit popup question is ignored
# 1 for dokan transition (pipes)
# 2 for doors (the only value doors actually function with)
# 3 for world exits (bero and non bero) (always boots you to world map)
# 4 for zone transitions (only used in 2 test maps)
# 5 for level exits (both royal and goal)
# 6 for save block continues (and main plaza autosave?) (no exit only enter)
21:0:1:Type
# Value range: [0;10]
# 0: n  - north
# 1: ne - north east
# 2: e  - east
# 3: se - south east
# 4: s  - south
# 5: sw - south west
# 6: w  - west
# 7: nw - north west
# 8: u  - up
# 9: d  - down
# 10:   - event transitions (mario does not move)
# -1 for types 4, 5 and 6 sicne those do not work based on direction
21:1:1:Direction
# 0  for door to non door connection
# 1  for door to door connection
# -1 for non doors
